SAM 3 video: an opt-in NMS across text prompts (Sam3VideoConfig.cross_prompt_nms_thresh, off by default).

Upstream pin: transformers @ v5.12.1 (ddb849abe009d1089e6c691bfc897f27211c663c)

SAM 3 video runs its detection NMS per text prompt, so with a long prompt list one object found by
several prompts -- "person", "man", "dancer" -- becomes several objects, each tracked from then on.
This adds a config value: when it is above 0, each frame's merged detections from all prompts go
through one more greedy mask NMS at that IoU, keeping the highest-scoring detection whichever
prompt found it. It defaults to 0.0, which leaves upstream behaviour unchanged; reifyscene's SAM 3
labeller sets it (0.5, so a part inside a whole, such as a shirt on a person, is not suppressed).
This is reifyscene's addition, not part of the original SAM 3. It depends on 0001 for
greedy_nms_from_ious.

Without it: reifyscene's vocabulary of ~90 phrases per clip turns each person into several tracks.

